#
# Provides the ColorDistance class with static functions for computing perceptual
# and mathematical distance between two RGB colors. Includes standard Euclidean
# distance in RGB space and the weighted redmean algorithm that approximates
# human color perception by weighting channels based on the average red value
# of the two colors being compared.
